---
import { EBAY } from "../consts";
---

<section class="section" id="about">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="about-copy">
        <span class="eyebrow">Why TimeLag</span>
        <h2>Raising the Bar for Retro Game Experiences</h2>
        <p>
          How many times have you bought a game online or at your local shop only to find
          out it was never tested, the controller&rsquo;s defective, and the console can&rsquo;t read
          discs? TimeLag Video Games takes a different approach.
        </p>
        <p>
          We carefully curate our selection of games, accessories, and collectibles —
          specializing in Japanese imports. Everything we buy across the PNW and import
          from around the world is the highest quality, independently tested by multiple
          sources, and fully refurbished to the same reliability you&rsquo;d expect fresh out
          of the box.
        </p>
        <p>
          That includes handhelds and home consoles like region-free Nintendo GameCubes,
          so you can play your US <em>and</em> Japanese games. You&rsquo;ll also find nostalgic
          media and merch from anime and pop-culture icons around the world.
        </p>
        <p>
          Your time is valuable, and you care about clean, reliable items in your
          collection — not dust-covered consoles that fail right after the warranty
          expires, leaving you frustrated and defeated.
        </p>
        <p class="ko">▶ Avoid the KO.</p>
        <a href={EBAY.storeUrl} class="btn btn-primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Shop TimeLag now ↗</a>
      </div>

      <div class="quality-list">
        <div class="quality"><span class="badge" aria-hidden="true">🔬</span><div><h3>Independently Tested</h3><p>Verified by multiple sources before it ever hits the shelf.</p></div></div>
        <div class="quality"><span class="badge" aria-hidden="true">✨</span><div><h3>Fully Refurbished</h3><p>Cleaned and restored to like-new, out-of-the-box reliability.</p></div></div>
        <div class="quality"><span class="badge" aria-hidden="true">🌏</span><div><h3>Region-Free Imports</h3><p>GameCubes &amp; more that play your US and Japanese libraries.</p></div></div>
        <div class="quality"><span class="badge" aria-hidden="true">🎌</span><div><h3>Niche &amp; Collectible</h3><p>Anime &amp; pop-culture merch and hard-to-find Japanese exclusives.</p></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-grid { display: grid; gap: clamp(1.75rem, 1rem + 3vw, 3.5rem); align-items: start; }
  @media (min-width: 920px) { .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr; } }
  .about-copy p { margin-bottom: 1rem; max-width: 62ch; }
  .ko {
    font-family: var(--font-mono); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.04em; color: var(--yellow);
    text-shadow: 0 0 14px rgba(232, 162, 74, 0.5); font-size: 1.05rem; margin: 0.4rem 0 1.5rem;
  }
  .quality-list { display: grid; gap: 0.8rem; margin-top: 0.5rem; }
  .quality {
    display: flex; gap: 0.85rem; align-items: flex-start; padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 0;
    clip-path: polygon(16px 0, 100% 0, calc(100% - 16px) 100%, 0 100%);
  }
  .quality:nth-child(1) { background: #df5e39; border-color: transparent; }
  .quality:nth-child(2) { background: #cd804c; border-color: transparent; }
  .quality:nth-child(3) { background: #468596; border-color: transparent; }
  .quality:nth-child(4) { background: #f39ccd; border-color: transparent; }
  .quality h3, .quality p { color: var(--accent-ink); }
  .quality .badge {
    width: 2.5rem; height: 2.5rem; font-size: 1.15rem; flex: none;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55); border: 0; border-radius: 0;
    clip-path: polygon(7px 0, 100% 0, calc(100% - 7px) 100%, 0 100%);
  }
  .quality h3 { font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 0.15rem; }
  .quality p { font-size: 0.9rem; margin: 0; }
</style>
